xpected assists. _(Sample: 6 PL matches.)_\n\n**Chance quality versus the league.** Spurs rank 18th of 20 for xG created per match (1.11) and 9th for estimated xG conceded per 90 (1.43). _(Sample: 6 PL matches each.)_\n\n**8 players flagged.** Bentancur: Suspended — Suspended until 7 Nov; Sávio: Injured — Muscular injury - Expected back 7 Nov; Pedro Porro: Injured — Hamstring injury - Expected back 24 Oct; Bergvall: Injured — Knee injury - Expected back 7 Nov; Mudryk: Injured — Ankle injury - Unknown return date; Xavi: Injured — Knee injury - Unknown return date; Odobert: Injured — Knee injury - Unknown return date; Kulusevski: Doubtful — Knee injury - 75% chance of playing _(Sample: Latest FPL availability flags.)_\n\n## What this data cannot show\n\nBuild-up structure, pressing, rotations, set-piece routines and formations need event or tracking data that is not freely available, so they are not assessed here.\n\n## Sources\n\n- FPL Core Insights — github.com/olbauday/FPL-Elo-Insights (shots, passing, take-ons, possession; match data collected from FotMob)\n- Fantasy Premier League API — fantasy.premierleague.com/api (fixtures, results, player statistics; Opta-derived xG/xA)\n- TheSportsDB — thesportsdb.com (non-Premier League fixtures and score cross-check)\n- YouTube — official Tottenham Hotspur and Premier League channels (video metadata)"}
